{"id":"605864","name":"酸包菜肉龙","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/605864/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酸包菜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"肉糜","amount":"300g"},{"name":"发酵好的面","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"酸包菜。","img":"images/605864/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅煮一下。","img":"images/605864/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出洗一下，撰干水分切末。","img":"images/605864/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱拍一下，姜切丝。","img":"images/605864/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"全部切成末。","img":"images/605864/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取肉糜。","img":"images/605864/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放葱姜和酸包菜。","img":"images/605864/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/605864/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/605864/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放食用油和椒盐。","img":"images/605864/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/605864/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"发好的面。","img":"images/605864/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取出来揉光排气。","img":"images/605864/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"尽量擀成长方形大饼。","img":"images/605864/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"抹上肉馅。","img":"images/605864/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/605864/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"剩的面揉成馒头，放蒸笼里。","img":"images/605864/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"二次发酵。","img":"images/605864/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"发酵好的肉龙和馒头，大火烧开，改中火蒸30分钟。","img":"images/605864/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"焖几分钟即可。","img":"images/605864/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"切开。","img":"images/605864/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/605864/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"蒸的时间长短取决于肉龙跟馒头的大小。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}